---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="About Engineering Supplies Inc.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-24">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight">About</h1>
    <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-ink/70">
      <p>
        We're passionate about education and believe that by equipping classrooms with the right technology, we
        can change the way people learn around the world. Our classroom and meeting room solutions allow people to
        transform their everyday surfaces into smart, connected environments that make learning and working more
        seamless.
      </p>
      <p>
        Engineering Supplies, Inc. is headquartered in Virginia, USA. Since we were founded in 1989, we've focused
        on providing innovative solutions for education and business.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
